# 6 Summary

1. Photon-exchange 1/t² is an infrared, soft-photon divergence.

2. Compton/annihilation/pair-production poles are collinear fermion singularities, not Rutherford's.

3. Virtual loops produce log(1/λ); real soft emission produces the opposite log.

4. Their sum is finite and depends on the detector resolution ΔE.

5. Exclusive no-extra-photon rates are not observables in QED.

